{#
  Sign-up call to action, guests only (the caller checks current_user).
  Sells the one thing registering unlocks: a personal Grimoire.
  Optional `cta_next`: path to return to after signing up/logging in.
#}
<aside class="panel signup-cta">
    <h2>Keep your own Grimoire</h2>
    <p>Sign up free and the recipes you love are yours to keep: bookmark favourites,
        and write down your own recipes, all gathered in your personal Grimoire.</p>
    <p>
        <a class="button" href="/register">Sign up</a>
        <small>Already a member? <a href="/login{% if cta_next is defined %}?next={{ cta_next|url_encode }}{% endif %}">Log in</a></small>
    </p>
</aside>
